{"language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.64, "text": " They went to the bathroom like this in the 1600s", "words": [{"word": " They", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18}, {"word": " went", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.34}, {"word": " to", "start": 0.34, "end": 0.46}, {"word": " the", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.6}, {"word": " bathroom", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.88}, {"word": " like", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.14}, {"word": " this", "start": 1.14, "end": 1.46}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.46, "end": 1.62}, {"word": " the", "start": 1.62, "end": 1.78}, {"word": " 1600s", "start": 1.78, "end": 2.64}]}, {"start": 2.64, "end": 5.04, "text": " and it helped spread diseases like typhoid fever.", "words": [{"word": " and", "start": 2.64, "end": 2.74}, {"word": " it", "start": 2.74, "end": 2.9}, {"word": " helped", "start": 2.9, "end": 3.1}, {"word": " spread", "start": 3.1, "end": 3.38}, {"word": " diseases", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.82}, {"word": " like", "start": 3.82, "end": 4.1}, {"word": " typhoid", "start": 4.1, "end": 4.66}, {"word": " fever.", "start": 4.66, "end": 5.04}]}, {"start": 5.72, "end": 8.12, "text": " They went to the bathroom like this in the 1800s", "words": [{"word": " They", "start": 5.72, "end": 5.82}, {"word": " went", "start": 5.82, "end": 5.96}, {"word": " to", "start": 5.96, "end": 6.1}, {"word": " the", "start": 6.1, "end": 6.22}, {"word": " bathroom", "start": 6.22, "end": 6.48}, {"word": " like", "start": 6.48, "end": 6.74}, {"word": " this", "start": 6.74, "end": 7.1}, {"word": " in", "start": 7.1, "end": 7.26}, {"word": " the", "start": 7.26, "end": 7.38}, {"word": " 1800s", "start": 7.38, "end": 8.12}]}, {"start": 8.12, "end": 9.46, "text": " and people were still getting sick", "words": [{"word": " and", "start": 8.12, "end": 8.2}, {"word": " people", "start": 8.2, "end": 8.44}, {"word": " were", "start": 8.44, "end": 8.6}, {"word": " still", "start": 8.6, "end": 8.9}, {"word": " getting", "start": 8.9, "end": 9.16}, {"word": " sick", "start": 9.16